    <string name="nav_builder">Builder</string>
    <string name="builder_heading">Payload builder</string>
    <string name="builder_description">Reads the kernel symbol table out of a boot.img, resolves the offsets this exploit chain needs, and rewrites the chosen base library into a build that matches your kernel. Tapping "Build payload" asks which scheme to use first: the universal one covers most devices, while vivo / iQOO needs the build carrying the vr.ko anti-root bypass. Everything happens on-device — no network.</string>
